      "severity": "high",
      "claim": "config.py requires os.environ[\"SMTP_HOST\"] with no default; README and .env.example only list SMTP_PORT, LOG_LEVEL, and API_TIMEOUT_SECONDS. Fresh deploys following docs will fail at import.",
